---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="S4 · LiDAR to DEM accuracy assessment" description="Ground classification of public LiDAR and an accuracy report against check points — in progress.">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Project S4 · LiDAR &amp; terrain analysis</p>
      <h1>LiDAR to DEM accuracy assessment</h1>
      <p class="lede">Re-classifying ground points in the same public LiDAR used for S1 and comparing the result against the
        data source's own classification, then generating a DEM and contours and scoring their accuracy against the S1
        check points.</p>
      <span class="status planned">In progress</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Planned deliverables</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li>PDAL ground classification compared point-for-point against the source-classified ground surface</li>
    <li>DEM and contours generated from the reclassified ground, RMSE reported against the S1 field check points</li>
    <li>Optional: a second DSM built with WebODM from public drone imagery, for a three-way comparison</li>
  </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
